					"rH": 244,
					"rV": 83,
					"html": "• Every login and read crosses the VPN — an on-prem outage stalls the whole portal ( tunnels are redundant, the site is not )<br>• Throughput is capped by the IdP and the Sanitized Reader<br>• Sanitization <i>is</i> the sovereignty guarantee — allowlist fields only; joins / aggregates can re-identify<br>• Caching sanitized data cloud-side would ease load, at the cost of the sovereignty claim",
